#. de: Ausgabe[p] von „Abenteuergeschichten: Reise eines Gehilfen II“
#. fr: exemplaire des “Contes d'aventures<nbsp>: Carrière d'un servant II”
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of one retainer's path to becoming a desperately sought-after servitor─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Hand over to instantly raise the level of a retainer up to a maximum of 70. (Retainer level cannot exceed current character level in the relevant class/job.)
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
