#. column 0: copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of one retainer's path to becoming a desperately sought-after servitor─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Hand over to instantly raise the level of a retainer up to a maximum of 70. (Retainer level cannot exceed current character level in the relevant class/job.)
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:25201:0:2"
msgid "copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II</i>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ある気鋭リテイナーが歩んだ冒険の記録。<br>リテイナーに渡すことでリテイナーのレベルを最大70に引き上げる（ただし、雇用主の該当クラス／ジョブレベルがレベルアップの上限になる）
#. de: Eine detaillierte Aufzeichnung eines Gehilfen über seine Entwicklung zu einem heiß begehrten Diener - so detailliert, dass der Leser glaubt, die geschilderten Ereignisse selbst erlebt zu haben.<br><br>Übergib das Buch an einen Gehilfen, um ihn unmittelbar auf Stufe 70 aufsteigen zu lassen. (Achtung: Ein Gehilfe kann keine höhere Stufe als sein Auftraggeber einnehmen.)
#. fr: Un journal dans lequel un servant cabotin a couché sur le papier le récit de sa longue carrière.<br>Permet d'augmenter le niveau de votre servant jusqu'à 70, mais pas au-delà de votre propre niveau dans cette classe ou ce job.
#. column 0: copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II</i>
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II</i>
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey II
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:25201:0:8"
msgid "A detailed record of one retainer's path to becoming a desperately sought-after servitor─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Hand over to instantly raise the level of a retainer up to a maximum of 70. (Retainer level cannot exceed current character level in the relevant class/job.)"
msgstr ""

